            "fontSize": 20,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "A specific frustration: she doesn't know how to start conversations or figure\nout who has similar interests\n\n\nA meaningful goal: she wants to feel comfortable at school and have at least\none close friend she can talk to during the day\n\n",
            "textAlign": "left",
